![Classic.com](classic.png)

Classic.com is a startup headquartered in Miami (USA). A search
engine specialized in car auctions.

I worked with the experience team (Elixir Frontend) and the backend
team (GraphQL JavaScript) to deliver bug solutions, improve code
organization, and provide new features to an existing codebase built
with Elixir, Tailwind, and Surface UI. The main focus was within the
Experience team.

I implemented new endpoints in the GraphQL backend using JavaScript.

I implemented new frontend features using SurfaceUI and Tailwind.

I submitted code organization and improvement proposals.

I helped team members debug issues in pair programming sessions.

Project carried out between February and October 2022.
